<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>04-约束 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/RustByExample/generics/04-bounds/</link><description>Recent content in 04-约束 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 22:34:20 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/RustByExample/generics/04-bounds/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>01-测试实例：空约束</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/RustByExample/generics/04-bounds/01-testcase-empty/</link><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 21:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/RustByExample/generics/04-bounds/01-testcase-empty/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
